   "source": [
    "segment_channel = responses.merge(\n",
    "    customers[\n",
    "    [\"Customer_ID\", \"Customer_Segment\", \"Acquisition_Channel\"]\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    on = \"Customer_ID\",\n",
    "    how = \"left\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "segment_channel_analysis = segment_channel.groupby(\n",
    "    [\"Customer_Segment\", \"Acquisition_Channel\"]\n",
    ").agg(\n",
    "    Responses = (\"Response_ID\", \"count\"),\n",
    "    Conversions = (\"Converted\", \"sum\")\n",
    ").reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "segment_channel_analysis[\"Conversion_Rate\"] = (\n",
    "    segment_channel_analysis[\"Conversions\"] /\n",
    "    segment_channel_analysis[\"Responses\"]\n",
    ") * 100\n",
    "\n",
    "segment_channel_analysis.sort_values(\n",
    "    [\"Customer_Segment\", \"Conversion_Rate\"],\n",
    "    ascending = [True, False]\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8ae0bbc5-ce35-464b-83a0-b4e6956e1e58",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. At Risk customers :\n",
    "   Insight: Facebook is the strongest channel for At Risk customers.\n",
    "   Recommendation: Use Facebook re-engagement campaigns for At Risk customers, with personalized offers or reminders.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Discount Seekers :\n",
    "   Insight: Facebook again performs best.\n",
    "   Recommendation: Use Facebook promotional campaigns, coupons, flash sales and limited-time offers for Discount Seekers.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. High Value customers :\n",
    "   Insight: Facebook is also strongest for High Value customers, while Instagram is weakest.\n",
    "   Recommendation: Prioritize Facebook for VIP/retention campaigns and avoid assuming Instagram is the best channel simply     because it may generate engagement.\n",
    "\n",
    "4. Potential customers :\n",
    "   Insight: Google performs best for Potential customers.\n",
    "   Recommendation: Use Google campaigns to nurture Potential customers toward higher-value behavior.\n",
    "   \n",
    "Novacart should use segment-specific channel allocation: Facebook is particularly effective for At Risk, Discount Seeker and High Value customers, while Google is stronger for Potential customers."
   ]
  },
