   "source": [
    "What is the business problem here?\n",
    "\n",
    "The biggest drop happens between:\n",
    "Impressions → Clicks\n",
    "Only 3.44% of impressions become clicks.\n",
    "That means Novacart has a huge audience reach, but only a small percentage engages with the advertisement.\n",
    "So one potential business opportunity is:\n",
    "Improve ad engagement through better creatives, targeting, messaging and calls-to-action."
   ]
