  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "862982e7-98fe-424a-9969-02758e5669cb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. Google — strongest funnel\n",
    "\n",
    "Google has:\n",
    "\n",
    "CTR: 3.55%\n",
    "Click → Conversion: 6.23%\n",
    "Highest conversions: 101,448\n",
    "\n",
    "This means Google isn't just generating clicks—it is also converting those clicks better than every other channel.\n",
    "\n",
    "Business insight: Google is Novacart's strongest end-to-end acquisition channel based on the current funnel metrics.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Facebook — strongest CTR\n",
    "\n",
    "Facebook has the highest CTR: 3.56%\n",
    "\n",
    "But its Click → Conversion rate is: 5.71%\n",
    "\n",
    "So Facebook is excellent at generating engagement, but Google is better at converting that traffic.\n",
    "\n",
    "Interpretation: Facebook appears stronger at attracting users, while Google is stronger at converting users after they click.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Instagram — funnel weakness at the top\n",
    "\n",
    "Instagram has the lowest CTR: 3.18%\n",
    "\n",
    "But its Click → Conversion is: 5.61%\n",
    "\n",
    "So the people who click Instagram ads are reasonably likely to convert.\n",
    "\n",
    "This suggests:\n",
    "The primary opportunity for Instagram is improving ad engagement/CTR, rather than necessarily fixing the post-click conversion experience.\n",
    "\n",
    "Potential improvements:\n",
    "Better creative\n",
    "Stronger CTA\n",
    "Better audience targeting\n",
    "Different ad messaging\n",
    "More compelling offers \n",
    "\n",
    "4. YouTube — biggest conversion weakness\n",
    "YouTube has:\n",
    "\n",
    "CTR = 3.46%\n",
    "\n",
    "which isn't particularly bad.\n",
    "\n",
    "But:\n",
    "\n",
    "Click → Conversion = 5.10%\n",
    "\n",
    "which is the lowest among all channels.\n",
    "\n",
    "This means YouTube can generate clicks, but those clicks convert less effectively.\n",
    "\n",
    "Business interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "YouTube's main weakness appears to be post-click conversion, rather than initial engagement.\n",
    "\n",
    "Novacart should investigate:\n",
    "Landing-page relevance\n",
    "Offer alignment\n",
    "Audience targeting\n",
    "Video-to-landing-page consistency\n",
    "Call-to-action effectiveness"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2170d3fe-bf99-4f55-a795-9f1e559314d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This gives us a very strong business recommendation\n",
    "\n",
    "Don't simply tell Novacart: \"Increase Google spending.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead:\n",
    "\n",
    "Google : Scale carefully because it has the strongest end-to-end funnel and ROAS.\n",
    "\n",
    "Facebook : Optimize for conversion, because it already generates strong engagement.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instagram : Improve CTR, because people who click are converting reasonably well.\n",
    "\n",
    "YouTube : Improve post-click experience, because clicks aren't converting as effectively.\n",
    "\n",
    "Email : Maintain/optimize because it has a respectable conversion rate with relatively low spend."
   ]
  },
